      "title": "Another Republican comes out against Todd Blanche’s attorney general nomination, narrowing his path to confirmation – live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/aug/07/donald-trump-ohio-republican-max-miller-domestic-abuse-allegations-birthright-citizenship-us-politics-latest",
      "description": "<p>Republican senator Lisa Murkowski ⁠of Alaska ⁠said she ⁠will oppose president ⁠Donald Trump’s nominee ​for ‌attorney ‌general</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/07/murkowski-todd-blanche-attorney-general\">Murkowski won’t support Blanche’s attorney general bid</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US email</a></p></li></ul><p>Donald Trump will begin his day in Washington. <strong>We can expect to hear from the president at 3pm ET </strong>when he holds a roundtable event at the state department on American mining. We’ll bring you the latest as that gets under way.</p><p>Trump will then travel to Bedminster, New Jersey where he’ll be through the weekend.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/aug/07/donald-trump-ohio-republican-max-miller-domestic-abuse-allegations-birthright-citizenship-us-politics-latest\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-07T12:20:16"
    },
    {
      "title": "Murkowski won’t vote for Trump’s nomination of Blanche as attorney general",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/07/murkowski-todd-blanche-attorney-general",
      "description": "<p>Alaska Republican is concerned that proposed fund to compensate January 6 rioters will proceed even though Blanche confirmed it was dead</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/aug/07/donald-trump-ohio-republican-max-miller-domestic-abuse-allegations-birthright-citizenship-us-politics-latest\">US politics live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>Lisa Murkowski, Alaska’s moderate Republican senator, announced early on Friday that she will not vote for Donald Trump’s nomination of Todd Blanche as US attorney general, leaving his elevation from “acting” to official confirmation in the post even narrower.</p><p>Murkowski issued a statement expressing her concerns that the Trump administration could proceed with its proposed fund to compensate rioters who invaded the US Capitol on January 6 in a failed attempt to overturn Joe Biden’s defeat of Trump in the 2020 presidential election.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/07/murkowski-todd-blanche-attorney-general\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-07T12:00:42"
    }
